  "reviewNote": "Completed two full English/Czech readings of the final seventeen rows after refinement. Verified Sebastian’s low-heart withdrawal, smoking relapse, private walk, understated family visit, New Year hangover, Sam friendship, dislike of the flower-dance outfit, sunscreen, Luau, moonlight-jelly tradition, fair crowd avoidance, Spirit’s Eve, winter plans, fishing contest and exact celebration item. Applied all festival terms and checked player neutrality and every marker; no further issue found.",
