    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueSebastian",
      "key": "spring_23",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Oh... tomorrow's the flower dance, isn't it? Do we have to go?#$e#I hate wearing that ridiculous tight jumpsuit. Why does Lewis make us do this?$s",
      "translation": "Ach... zítra je Květinový tanec, že? Musíme tam jít?#$e#Nesnáším ten směšný těsný overal. Proč nás Lewis nutí tohle dělat?$s",
      "sourceSHA256": "792b49a957ae69385ecf2a073b2ac9339162276509e1d1e8aed1deb112d50064",
      "translationSHA256": "7bc1845cb9692834998cf96f8ad44bdc939af25394d14f38211e28c90371fbc7",
      "reviewChecks": [
