    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueSebastian",
      "key": "summer_1",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Summer's here... I need to start slathering the sunscreen pretty thick if I want to maintain my pale complexion...",
      "translation": "Léto je tady... Jestli si chci zachovat bledou pleť, budu se muset začít mazat pořádnou vrstvou opalovacího krému...",
      "sourceSHA256": "2113eb117739ad7852fa523773ac65646f481cd6257fd56384e79005e8586f91",
      "translationSHA256": "a3f771eb8156f60d2a0460083ea01a971763d3a5cc16db8364c05b43a8639f00",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
