    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueSebastian",
      "key": "summer_27",
      "field": null,
      "source": "The weather's starting to cool off. It feels great.#$e#Should we go to the festival tomorrow night? It's actually a tradition I kind of enjoy.$7",
      "translation": "Počasí se začíná ochlazovat. Je to příjemné.#$e#Půjdeme zítra večer na festival? Je to vlastně tradice, kterou mám docela rád.$7",
      "sourceSHA256": "337eb09f02c4baba36c0c61b1743e95c72233c77e259abb09dc78d0300a003d8",
      "translationSHA256": "e67ed8a2b0417f731e0d7a99d5df9b3434fd6ba85a44acac3ec1701f39b10d4c",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
