    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueSebastian",
      "key": "fall_1",
      "field": null,
      "source": "It seems like the whole valley's changed overnight... I guess fall's finally here.",
      "translation": "Vypadá to, že se celé údolí přes noc proměnilo... Podzim je asi konečně tady.",
      "sourceSHA256": "7f310b57d6b670dc5debc7e73fb7018bb9b769dd7eb12fddd42d65a39a3a17ed",
      "translationSHA256": "344375f9022881aa7fae5cd3ce3260ca15156d6f2112cd66b2368358cfdc7117",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueSebastian",
      "key": "fall_15",
      "field": null,
      "source": "The Stardew Valley Fair is a little crowded for my tastes... but I'll just hang out with Sam. It'll be good to catch up with him.#$e#You should play some carnival games, though! Don't worry about me.$7",
      "translation": "Jarmark údolí Stardew je na můj vkus trochu přeplněný... ale budu tam se Samem. Bude fajn probrat, co je u něj nového.#$e#Ty si ale zahraj nějaké pouťové hry! O mě se neboj.$7",
      "sourceSHA256": "a3751a36801b9ec5f3980e750684588e9279ce548da85aa332a653a361b237c3",
      "translationSHA256": "8dcda4616597bb613ba3118158ce11dcced5fa24062db1525e425cbe20b0e71f",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
