    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueSebastian",
      "key": "winter_1",
      "field": null,
      "source": "What are your plans this winter? I know it's more of a laid-back time for you.",
      "translation": "Jaké máš plány na zimu? Vím, že je to pro tebe klidnější období.",
